            "notes": "Round 1 is nothing fancy, your goal is to get 10k total credits by round 2 when the fun really starts\n\nThe first power you always get is [Multiball](item_5d0e4135-f4e1-42fb-991a-417643064560) \n\nThe First 3 items you want for round one will be  [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)  [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) and  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) \n\nThese 3 for round 1 will maximize your output for everything and get you the most amount of creds, no need to worry about survival powers for now as moria has great survivability on her own, if situations get tough fade out and try your best not to die",
