            "notes": "Now with round 2 you have 2 options.\n\nmy main option (option 1) is to go for  [Alternative Energy](item_c3e816b3-9c39-4528-9578-e3fa610b6cc6) , so every time you fade you refuel your biotic energy, you take longer then 8 seconds to use all your biotic energy so once you have this you have inf healing, with any credits left over i would invest into survival as your fade will now be used for refilling your energy and not as an escape route. if you have had a amazing round get  [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) if your round was still good get [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6).\n\n(option 2) if you feel like your cycle with biotic energy is good and your never running out of energy, and your orbs are lacking, get  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) and  [Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be)",
