            "created_at": "2025-07-17T08:24:49.984912+00:00",
            "notes": "Round 3 is here and now the orb spam begins, depending on what you chose for round 2, add on the other option for this round.\n\nwith the power  [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d) you now send out your last selected orb every 50 biotic energy you use. since you now also have [Alternative Energy](item_c3e816b3-9c39-4528-9578-e3fa610b6cc6) you will be sending out orbs non stop and your team will have healing for the rest of their life. if your team doesn't need that much heals bc you have a healbot mercy or smth, you can chose your damage orbs and keep sending them out while also still providing decent healing from your biotic grasp.  if you have any extra creds you can spend them on whatever you would like, if your dying before your team get survival, if your team dies bc you cant outheal the enemies dmg get ap or wp, you now have inf of both so it doesn't matter.",
