            "notes": "from round 4 on we will keep  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) and  [Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be) untill we need to sell them for other purple powers\n\nwith your healing output atm you should be making 10k a round. you can also do decent damage so you really shouldn't be lacking in credits. with this the next item we will get will be  [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b). this is one of the most valuable items moria has, 25 health and 10% wp, with the addon that for every healing done you get 5% ap for 3 seconds staking up to 5 times, bc you now never run out of biotic energy this 25% ap boos should be active most of the round.",
