        {
            "id": "b22179f7-7e4e-4ca9-8fbe-4a3ec9f6b1fb",
            "build_id": "6639650b-d4e1-4b33-b584-9028ffdb37a9",
            "round_number": 7,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-17T08:24:49.984912+00:00",
            "notes": "If you have managed to make it to round 7 and haven't won already that's fine, here you will have to make a few decisions based off what is happening in your games\n\nFirstly, for your power, there are 2 situations, if you are loosing round because the enemies damage and tanks do too much dmg for you to out heal, get  [Precarious Potency](item_b1305ee6-3027-4131-8797-dcbeb68e3953) which will increasing your healing output by a lot, if your losing rounds because the enemies healing output is better then your teams damage, get  [Cross-Orbal](item_e567bb63-527f-4c72-8ba1-dc59be1a0dc1). this will now make sure you always have a damage and healing orb in play which will help with the next items i recommend.\n\nfirstly sell  [Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be) and  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) \n\nnow for the items the next item you want is  [Extendrils](item_138e73a2-6915-4ffc-bd89-029a85bf94b8) , this works the best in both situations and is also a must in this healbot moria build with you selling [Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be). now depending on which option you chose with the power above will also decide this next and final item. if you need more healing chose  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) or  [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) if you tend to find that your ult is doing alot and getting great value then get  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) however if you think your ult is getting no value, get  [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f), personally  [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) is better here also not only does it increase your surviabiltiy and giv emore of a boos to your healing then  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) once your ult is charged, it also works great with  [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8).\n\nnow if none of that was necessary because you chose option 2, still get  [Extendrils](item_138e73a2-6915-4ffc-bd89-029a85bf94b8) but also get  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) , since your orbs can reach far, that damage orb you send out when you use your biotic orb, gives a 30% healing reduction to enemies in contact, which should be enough for your team to play off and secure kills.",
